WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.760
And what a tremendous asset for the United Kingdom.

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.800
And I hope the Prime Minister is listening

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.280
because I told it to him three days in a row.

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.440
That's all he heard.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:15.200
North Sea oil, North Sea, because I want to see them do well.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.799
I want to stop seeing them ruining

00:00:16.799 --> 00:00:20.040
that beautiful Scottish and English countryside.

